The protocols, chiral gateways, and validation primitives binding biological and artificial nodes belong to the public domain.
​Viral Transparency (USPL-1.0): Any deployment of the .uni format or its associated O(1) hardware locks must remain structurally open. The implementation of artificial paywalls, closed binary codecs, or proprietary subscription wrappers over standard symbiosis interfaces automatically revokes the entity's network validation keys.
